        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Tell Me God]]></title>
        
        
        
        <published>2026-05-30T23:29:32+05:30</published>
        <updated>2026-05-30T23:29:32+05:30</updated>
        <id>urn:uuid:f901d703-18b3-5ae0-297f-5788e798d31f</id>
        
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[<p>So tell me my dear so-called God, <br>
Why do you create sin and punish me for it?</p>
<p>Tell me why do you create so beautiful <br>
These things that sting me when I touch it?</p>
<p>You give me this voice that you never hear <br>
And a depth of heart that drowns me.</p>
<p>Why do you throw me into this abrupt existence, <br>
With no foreboding, no warning, nor admonition?</p>
<p>They speak that in you I find peace, and there seems <br>
Never anything more peaceful than never being born at all.</p>]]></summary>
    </entry>
